---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '如何在中国支付：外国游客完整指南';
const description = 'Alipay, WeChat Pay, cash, or credit cards — a complete overview of payment options in China for foreign visitors in 2026.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/payment/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Payment
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">💳 支付</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        How to Pay in China<br class="hidden md:block" />: Complete Guide for Foreign Visitors
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">大多数旅行者问的第一件事是：在中国，我实际上是如何付款的？</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读5分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>飞行前设置支付宝。</strong> Link your Visa or Mastercard to it — that covers 95% of your payments in China. Keep ¥500–1000 in cash as backup. WeChat Pay is a good secondary option. Physical credit cards work in limited places only.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Table of Contents -->
    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#short-answer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">💡 简短的回答</a></li>
        <li><a href="#what-most-do" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">👍 大多数旅行者都在做什么</a></li>
        <li><a href="#one-thing" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🔑 潜水前要知道的一件事</a></li>
        <li><a href="#which-method" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🤔 您应该使用哪种付款方式？</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        The first thing most travelers ask me about China is, <strong>“我到底是怎么为那里的东西付钱的？”</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        It's a fair question. Walk into any shop in China and nobody's pulling out a wallet. They're all scanning QR codes. It can feel intimidating if you're arriving from a country where tap-and-go means Apple Pay and you're still using cards for half your purchases.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        But here's the good news: <strong>在中国付款对外国人来说真的很简单。</strong> The system has opened up massively in the last couple of years.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="short-answer" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">💡</span> The Short Answer
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        You have four options:
      </p>

      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-4 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li><strong>支付宝</strong> — The most popular mobile payment app in China. Set it up with a foreign passport and international credit card in about 15 minutes. This is what I recommend for most travelers.</li>
        <li><strong>微信支付</strong> — Lives inside WeChat (China's everything app). Very similar to Alipay, but you'll need WeChat installed anyway (trust me, you'll want it).</li>
        <li><strong>现金</strong> — Yes, cash still works. But shops will struggle to give you change, and some smaller vendors might not have any on hand.</li>
        <li><strong>实体信用卡</strong> — Works at international hotels, some high-end malls, and airports. Don't rely on this as your main method.</li>
      </ol>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold"></th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center bg-blue-600">（必填）：下载，用您的国际号码注册，链接您的Visa/Mastercard</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center bg-green-600">（推荐）：下载微信、注册、验证身份、绑定卡</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center bg-orange-600">现金</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-center bg-purple-600">信用卡</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">各地都接受？</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">差不多</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">差不多</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">大多数地方</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">有限的</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">需要中国银行账户吗？</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">罚款+可能的入境禁令。不要冒险。</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">罚款+可能的入境禁令。不要冒险。</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">罚款+可能的入境禁令。不要冒险。</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">罚款+可能的入境禁令。不要冒险。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">Need Chinese phone number?</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">罚款+可能的入境禁令。不要冒险。</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">罚款+可能的入境禁令。不要冒险。</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">罚款+可能的入境禁令。不要冒险。</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">罚款+可能的入境禁令。不要冒险。</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">200元以下免费</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">3%以上<br/>货币兑换+银行手续费</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">3%以上<br/>货币兑换+银行手续费</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">DCC+银行手续费</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">DCC + bank fees</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="what-most-do" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">👍</span> What Most Travelers Do
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Seriously, just set up Alipay before you fly. Link your Visa or Mastercard to it. That covers 95% of your payments in China — from street food stalls to train tickets.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Keep some cash as backup (¥500–1000 should be plenty), and you're set.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        WeChat Pay is worth having too if you plan to use WeChat for messaging (which you probably will), but if you only set up one, make it Alipay.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="one-thing" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🔑</span> One Thing to Know Before We Dive In
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        The Chinese payment system runs on QR codes. Every merchant — from the guy selling roasted sweet potatoes on the corner to the ticketing counter at Shanghai Disneyland — has a QR code on their counter. You scan it with the app, enter the amount (or the merchant enters it), and tap pay. That's it.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Your foreign credit card sits behind the scenes. You link it once, then you use the app for everything. You almost never pull out the physical card. For a realistic look at where your card will and won't work, see our <a href="/zh/payment/foreign-cards/" class="text-brand-600 hover:underline">guide to using foreign credit cards in China</a>.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 id="which-method" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🤔</span> Which Payment Method Should You Use?
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-2">用您的护照和国际卡在15分钟内完成设置。在95%的地方工作。不需要中国银行账户。</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">外国人如何设置支付宝→</p>
          <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">推荐备份：微信支付</a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-2">有备份真好。微信也很有用，因为微信是中国人交流的方式——同时使用这两个应用程序意味着你被覆盖了。</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">外国人如何设置微信支付→</p>
          <a href="/zh/payment/setup-wechat/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">紧急情况：现金</a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-orange-900 mb-2">为小供应商、紧急情况或您的应用程序决定采取行动时，始终携带500-1000日元的小额账单。</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">📚 相关指南</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">外国人如何设置支付宝</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">外国人如何设置微信支付</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/setup-wechat/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">外国人如何设置微信支付</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">你可以在中国使用外国信用卡吗？</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/foreign-cards/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">你可以在中国使用外国信用卡吗？</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">付款失败时该怎么办</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-fails/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">付款失败时该怎么办</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">故障排除指南</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">VPN服务经常发生变化。没有单一的官方消息来源。在旅行前研究当前的建议。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://www.alipayplus.com/consumer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">支付宝-消费者中心</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://cs.help.wechat.com/hc/en-us" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">微信-帮助中心</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>